0:{"buildId":"HaSH0nfWkwbFYqcaqq3RQ","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"x:mx-auto x:flex x:max-w-(--nextra-content-width)","children":["$","$L2",null,{"value":[{"value":"Method","id":"method","depth":2},{"value":"Parameters","id":"parameters","depth":2},{"value":"Returns","id":"returns","depth":2},{"value":"Usage","id":"usage","depth":2},{"value":"Notes","id":"notes","depth":2},{"value":"Related Methods","id":"related-methods","depth":2}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","$L4",null,{"metadata":{"title":"disconnect","filePath":"content/hooks/useWalletConnect/disconnect.mdx","timestamp":1770719093000},"sourceCode":"# disconnect\n\nDisconnects the currently connected wallet and clears the connection state.\n\n## Method\n\n`disconnect()`\n\n## Parameters\n\nNone\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise<void>` - Resolves when disconnection is complete\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\n  import { useWalletConnect } from \"__PACKAGE_NAME__\";\n\n  function DisconnectButton() {\n    const { disconnect, isConnected } = useWalletConnect();\n\n    if (!isConnected) {\n      return <div>Not connected</div>;\n    }\n\n    return <button onClick={disconnect}>Disconnect</button>;\n  }\n\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Clears all wallet connection state\n- Resets account information\n- User will need to reconnect to use wallet features again\n- This is an async operation\n\n## Related Methods\n\n- `openModal()` - Opens the wallet connection modal\n- `isConnected` - Boolean state indicating connection status","children":[["$","div",null,{"id":"nextra-skip-nav"}],["$","main",null,{"data-pagefind-body":true,"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-bold x:mt-2 x:text-4xl","children":["disconnect","$undefined"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"Disconnects the currently connected wallet and clears the connection state."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"method","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Method",["$","$L5",null,{"id":"method"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":["$","$L6",null,{"children":"disconnect()"}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"parameters","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Parameters",["$","$L5",null,{"id":"parameters"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"None"}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"returns","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Returns",["$","$L5",null,{"id":"returns"}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":[["$","$L6",null,{"children":"Promise<void>"}]," - Resolves when disconnection is complete"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"usage","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Usage",["$","$L5",null,{"id":"usage"}]]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-6 mt-4 ml-6","children":["$","pre",null,{"className":"pl-5 pr-5 py-5 text-sm leading-relaxed border border-[var(--heroui-content2)] rounded-xl overflow-x-auto overflow-y-visible bg-[var(--heroui-content1)] whitespace-pre shadow-sm","style":{"maxHeight":"none"},"tabIndex":"0","data-language":"tsx","data-word-wrap":"","data-pagefind-ignore":"all","children":["$","$L6",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#D73A49","--shiki-dark":"#F97583"},"children":"  import"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292